===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[list]] of people or things that are [[assign]]ed to [[receive]] special [[attention]] or [[monitoring]].
#: {{ux|en|The police have hundreds of citizens on their '''watchlists'''.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2010|author=William J. Krouse|title=Terrorist Watchlist Checks and Air Passenger Prescreening|page=11|passage=The TSA provides the airlines with the “No Fly” and “Automatic Selectee” '''watchlists''' for use in identifying passengers who are to be denied boarding or who require additional scrutiny prior to boarding. The “No Fly” '''watchlist''' is a list of persons who are considered a direct threat to U.S. civil aviation.}}

